I am cooking now.
I watch the video once again.
In it, the chef gives instructions.
"First, put two spoons of oil in a pan."
So, I turn on the gas stove.
I put two spoons of oil in the pan.
Soon the oil becomes hot.
The chef says again, "Then, fry the peanuts."
I put the peanuts in the oil.
I fry them well.
What does the chef say after that?
He says, "After that, add mustard seeds and chopped onions."
I also do exactly that.
First, I add the mustard seeds.
Then the sound of the mustard seeds comes.
After that, I add the chopped onions to it.
I mix everything well.
A pleasant smell spreads in the kitchen.
Making Kande Pohe is very easy!
